[
  [
    "Title",
    "RGZWorkflow 1.0.0 \u2014 Diagnostics"
  ],
  [
    "Text",
    "Continue in the FeynCalc kernel used by Start Here after its fixed-gauge restore. Run section 1, then section 3 onward. Section 2 is only for a fresh kernel. Valid completed checkpoints are reused; failures and timeouts remain incomplete evidence."
  ],
  [
    "Section",
    "1 - Load the package and audit runtime"
  ],
  [
    "Input",
    "project=ParentDirectory[NotebookDirectory[]];\nIf[MemberQ[$Packages,\"RGZWorkflow`\"],Get[FileNameJoin[{project,\"Tools\",\"DiagnosticsCompatibility.wl\"}]],Get[FileNameJoin[{project,\"RGZWorkflow.wl\"}]]];\nGet[FileNameJoin[{project,\"Tools\",\"WeightedAuditResume.wl\"}]];"
  ],
  [
    "Section",
    "2 - Fresh kernel only: initialize and restore"
  ],
  [
    "Text",
    "Skip this section when continuing in the existing Start Here kernel. The root loader and runtime adapters install the guarded execution helper automatically."
  ],
  [
    "Input",
    "Get[FileNameJoin[{project,\"Tools\",\"DiagnosticsCompatibility.wl\"}]];\nRGZReport[RGZInitialize[FileNameJoin[{project,\"Work\"}],\"Display\"->\"Compact\"]];\nRGZReport[RGZLoadFeynCalc[]];\nRGZReport[RGZRestore[]];\nGet[FileNameJoin[{project,\"Tools\",\"WeightedAuditResume.wl\"}]];"
  ],
  [
    "Section",
    "3 - Source form factors, UV/IR and MSbar"
  ],
  [
    "Text",
    "Run these cells in order. Valid source-bound caches are reused. The MSbar and finite results are representations; complete mass and graph-weighted evidence remains necessary for certification."
  ],
  [
    "Input",
    "rgzDiagnosticRun[\"LoopFF\", RGZQQFormFactors[1200,\"LoopOrder\"->1,\"CoefficientSeconds\"->30], {}, Lookup[#,\"Status\",None]===\"Complete\"&];"
  ],
  [
    "Input",
    "rgzDiagnosticRun[\"Helpers\", RGZLoadFeynHelpers[], {}, Lookup[#,\"Status\",None]===\"FeynHelpersLoaded\"&];"
  ],
  [
    "Input",
    "rgzDiagnosticRun[\"UVIR\", RGZQQUVIR[1200,\"IntegralSeconds\"->30,\"CoefficientSeconds\"->30], {\"LoopFF\",\"Helpers\"}, (Lookup[#,\"Status\",None]===\"RepresentedPoleAnalysis\"&&TrueQ[Lookup[Lookup[#,\"Statistics\",<||>],\"CompleteRepresentedUV\",False]]&&TrueQ[Lookup[Lookup[#,\"Statistics\",<||>],\"CompleteRepresentedIR\",False]])&];"
  ],
  [
    "Input",
    "rgzDiagnosticRun[\"Scaleless\", RGZQQScalelessLedger[1200], {\"LoopFF\"}, Lookup[#,\"Status\",None]===\"RawScalelessCoreLedger\"&];"
  ],
  [
    "Input",
    "rgzDiagnosticRun[\"PVLedger\", RGZQQPVUVIRLedger[1200], {\"LoopFF\"}, AssociationQ[#]&];"
  ],
  [
    "Input",
    "RGZReport[RGZQQMSbarCounterterms[]];"
  ],
  [
    "Input",
    "rgzDiagnosticRun[\"MSbar\", RGZQQMSbar[1200], {\"UVIR\",\"Scaleless\"}, Lookup[#,\"Status\",None]===\"MSbarFiniteRepresentation\"&];"
  ],
  [
    "Section",
    "4 - Ordered mass and graph-weighted audits"
  ],
  [
    "Text",
    "Use the current model manifest and fixed Landau/M0 job. The unit inventory supplements the graph-weighted coverage check. The weighted limits are 144000 seconds overall, 12000 per graph and 600 per integral; they are ceilings, not predicted runtimes. Source-bound T/L assembly prefixes and completed components allow interrupted audits to resume. Supported scalar numerators are checked by exact full-D identities; unsupported cases retain the original replay."
  ],
  [
    "Input",
    "matrixState=RGZMixedStart[];\nmatrixManifest=If[AssociationQ[matrixState],FileNameJoin[{matrixState[\"CacheDirectory\"],\"matrix_job.wl\"}],Missing[\"MatrixRequired\"]];\nRGZReport[matrixState];\nfixedJobForAudit=RGZResult[\"QQ\"];\nfixedJobFile=If[AssociationQ[fixedJobForAudit]&&Lookup[fixedJobForAudit,\"Gauge\",None]===0&&Lookup[fixedJobForAudit,\"RegulatorMass\",None]===0&&StringQ[Lookup[fixedJobForAudit,\"Directory\",None]],FileNameJoin[{fixedJobForAudit[\"Directory\"],\"job.wxf\"}],Missing[\"FixedLandauTaskRequired\"]];"
  ],
  [
    "Input",
    "rgzDiagnosticRun[\"MixedUnits\", RGZQQMixedUVIRLedger[3600,\"MatrixManifest\"->matrixManifest,\"IntegralSeconds\"->120], {\"MSbar\"}, AssociationQ[#]&];"
  ],
  [
    "Input",
    "rgzDiagnosticRun[\"MassTadpoles\", RGZQQMassLimitLedger[7200,\"CoefficientSeconds\"->900], {\"MSbar\"}, Lookup[#,\"Status\",None]===\"MassLimitOrderAudit\"&];"
  ],
  [
    "Text",
    "If retrying the region cell after running mass completion, first rerun MassTadpoles to restore the original ledger as the active input. That preserves the same region checkpoint key."
  ],
  [
    "Input",
    "rgzDiagnosticRun[\"MassRegions\", RGZQQMassRegionMatch[7200,\"CoefficientSeconds\"->900], {\"MassTadpoles\"}, Lookup[#,\"Status\",None]===\"RegionCorrectionsCancel\"&];"
  ],
  [
    "Input",
    "rgzDiagnosticRun[\"RawMass\", RGZQQRawMassPoleAudit[7200,\"CoefficientSeconds\"->900], {\"MassTadpoles\"}, TrueQ[Lookup[#,\"AllPairsWithinBound\",False]]&];"
  ],
  [
    "Input",
    "rgzDiagnosticRun[\"Weighted\", RGZQQWeightedUVIRLedger[144000,\"JobFile\"->fixedJobFile,\"MatrixManifest\"->matrixManifest,\"IntegralSeconds\"->600,\"GraphSeconds\"->12000], {\"MSbar\"}, Lookup[#,\"Status\",None]===\"WeightedGraphCoverageVerified\"&];"
  ],
  [
    "Input",
    "rgzDiagnosticRun[\"MassCompletion\", RGZQQCompleteMassLedger[], {\"MassRegions\",\"RawMass\",\"Weighted\"}, TrueQ[Lookup[#,\"MassLimitUVIRCertified\",False]]&&TrueQ[Lookup[#,\"ScalelessLedgerComplete\",False]]&];"
  ],
  [
    "Section",
    "5 - Finite reconstruction and conditional certification"
  ],
  [
    "Input",
    "rgzDiagnosticRun[\"Finite\", RGZQQFiniteAudit[3600,\"CoefficientSeconds\"->120], {\"MSbar\"}, Lookup[#,\"Status\",None]===\"FiniteAssemblyVerified\"&];"
  ],
  [
    "Text",
    "Use the gaugeFile preserved in Start Here. The fallback below uses the prior certificate pointer, when present; the certification command still independently validates source jobs, hashes and payloads. It never upgrades a completion flag."
  ],
  [
    "Input",
    "If[!StringQ[gaugeFile],rgzPreviousCert=RGZResult[\"QQCertification\"];rgzGaugeFiles=If[AssociationQ[rgzPreviousCert],Lookup[rgzPreviousCert,\"EvidenceFiles\",{}],{}];If[ListQ[rgzGaugeFiles]&&Length[rgzGaugeFiles]===3&&StringQ[rgzGaugeFiles[[2]]],gaugeFile=rgzGaugeFiles[[2]]]];"
  ],
  [
    "Input",
    "rgzDiagnosticRun[\"Certification\", If[StringQ[gaugeFile],RGZQQCertification[\"GaugeFile\"->gaugeFile],RGZQQCertification[]], {\"MassCompletion\",\"Finite\"}, TrueQ[Lookup[#,\"FullSMatrixVerified\",False]]&];"
  ],
  [
    "Section",
    "6 - Scalar representation, poles, finite equivalence and presentation"
  ],
  [
    "Text",
    "This independent presentation can run while mass-limit audits are pending. Pole evidence must pass before finite equivalence; finite equivalence must pass before simplification. A failed prerequisite blocks dependent cells rather than producing a cascade of secondary errors."
  ],
  [
    "Input",
    "rgzDiagnosticRun[\"ScalarFF\", RGZQQScalarFormFactors[3600,\"CoefficientSeconds\"->60], {\"LoopFF\"}, MemberQ[{\"ScalarPVCollected\",\"ScalarPVCollectedExactCoefficientsRetained\"},Lookup[#,\"Status\",None]]&];"
  ],
  [
    "Input",
    "rgzDiagnosticRun[\"ScalarPole\", RGZQQScalarPoleAudit[3600,\"IntegralSeconds\"->60,\"CoefficientSeconds\"->120], {\"ScalarFF\",\"UVIR\"}, TrueQ[Lookup[#,\"CommonRegulatorPolesVerified\",False]]&];"
  ],
  [
    "Input",
    "rgzDiagnosticRun[\"ScalarBasis\", RGZQQScalarBasisAudit[1200], {\"ScalarFF\"}, AssociationQ[#]&];"
  ],
  [
    "Input",
    "rgzDiagnosticRun[\"ScalarFinite\", RGZQQScalarFiniteAudit[7200,\"CoefficientSeconds\"->180], {\"ScalarPole\",\"MSbar\",\"Finite\"}, TrueQ[Lookup[#,\"FiniteAmplitudeEquivalenceVerified\",False]]&];"
  ],
  [
    "Input",
    "rgzDiagnosticRun[\"ScalarCompact\", RGZQQScalarFiniteSimplify[3600,\"CoefficientSeconds\"->120], {\"ScalarFinite\"}, TrueQ[Lookup[#,\"ExactCoefficientEquivalenceVerified\",False]]&];"
  ],
  [
    "Input",
    "rgzDiagnosticRun[\"ScalarColor\", RGZQQScalarColorSimplify[3600,\"CoefficientSeconds\"->120], {\"ScalarCompact\"}, TrueQ[Lookup[#,\"ColorReconstructionVerified\",False]]&];"
  ],
  [
    "Input",
    "rgzDiagnosticRun[\"ScalarRows\", RGZQQScalarFactorRows[3600,\"RowSeconds\"->180], {\"ScalarColor\"}, AssociationQ[#]&];"
  ],
  [
    "Section",
    "7 - Final state and save"
  ],
  [
    "Input",
    "RGZReport[RGZIdentityRequirements[]];\nrgzDiagnosticState"
  ],
  [
    "Input",
    "rgzDiagnosticRun[\"SMatrix\", RGZQQSMatrix[], {\"Certification\"}, Lookup[#,\"Status\",None]===\"CertifiedWithinDeclaredDomain\"&];"
  ],
  [
    "Text",
    "Save also after an incomplete or timed-out audit. Completed checkpoints remain reusable. An incomplete certificate remains incomplete, with its outstanding checks and domain visible."
  ],
  [
    "Input",
    "RGZReport[RGZSave[]];"
  ]
]
